/**
 * How well known a destination is.
 *
 * The directory's photo-sourcing plan tiers the catalogue by demand — a
 * "hero set, top 30 by demand" that carries the homepage, then everything
 * else. The same tiering is what stops an auto-generated trip offering an
 * obscure park when the traveller almost certainly meant the famous one.
 *
 * This is a ranking signal, not a quality judgement: the quiet places are
 * often the better trip, which is why it is only ever a nudge.
 */

